  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can imbue your eyes with chakra, allowing you to see the life energy that flows through living things.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, Wis 13, Perception 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, you can invest essence into this feat. While essence is invested in this feat you can spend a move action to activate a special mode of sensory perception, chakra-sight, which allows you to accurately detect and pinpoint living creatures, regardless of invisibility or lighting conditions. This chakra-sight has a range equal to 5 feet per point of invested essence. The chakra-sight lasts until the start of your next turn. If you have the ability to bind a veil to your Headband slot, the chakra-sight granted by this feat is capable of detecting both living and nonliving creatures.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
